  "_description": "Control-plane / learner NO-co-location policy (scenario 1). The scheduler always sends masters as node_role=control-plane and learners as control-plane-learner (identity, independent of policy). One explicit C4 rule with a LIST selector over both roles and max_per_bm=1 forbids any two of the six from sharing a BM. Auto C3 still groups per role, so masters spread across 3 AGs and learners spread across 3 AGs independently; the C5 failover rule still distinguishes primary/backup by role. For the co-location-ALLOWED policy (scenario 2) drop max_per_bm_rules and set config.auto_generate_max_per_bm=true + default_max_per_bm=1.",
